WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:16.031
The buddies stomped and roared.

2
00:00:16.032 --> 00:00:20.715
The small dino stayed quiet.

3
00:00:20.716 --> 00:00:24.308
"Go away, Rex!" Sid said.

4
00:00:24.309 --> 00:00:28.124
"Get out of this forest!"

5
00:00:28.125 --> 00:00:32.572
"Don't tell me to go away," Rex said.

6
00:00:32.573 --> 00:00:36.129
"Yeah, Sid," Sara said.

7
00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:40.206
"We all play in this forest."

8
00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:43.538
Tor snorted.

9
00:00:43.539 --> 00:00:48.421
"I'm not playing with anyone!"

10
00:00:48.422 --> 00:00:52.204
"Fine!" Sara said.

11
00:00:52.205 --> 00:00:56.076
"I don't want to play anyway."

12
00:00:56.077 --> 00:00:59.937
"I'm staying," Rex said.

13
00:00:59.938 --> 00:01:03.594
He stomped his foot.

14
00:01:03.595 --> 00:01:10.114
"This is my spot!"

15
00:01:10.115 --> 00:01:13.055
Tor stood near a rock.

16
00:01:13.056 --> 00:01:15.931
"This rock is mine.

17
00:01:15.932 --> 00:01:24.185
Everyone, stay away!"

18
00:01:24.186 --> 00:01:27.862
Sid splashed in a pond.

19
00:01:27.863 --> 00:01:30.778
"This is my pond.

20
00:01:30.779 --> 00:01:35.443
Everyone, stay out of it!"

21
00:01:35.444 --> 00:01:41.555
Sara got a stick.

22
00:01:41.556 --> 00:01:50.978
She drew a line.

23
00:01:50.979 --> 00:01:56.021
"Nobody cross this line," she said.

24
00:01:56.022 --> 00:02:01.816
Rex, Sid, and Tor drew lines too.

25
00:02:01.817 --> 00:02:08.019
The buddies glared at each other.

26
00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:11.211
The small dino felt terrible.

